mprovement. So satisfying to see results straight away. — Michael. J<\/p>","url":"","rotate":-6}},"card_KzCYrR":{"type":"card","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC06615_copy.jpg","title":"Finally, a product made for dog wee burns!","text":"<p>I’ve only just started using Rescue, but so far I’m seriously impressed. Jess.C<\/p>","url":"","rotate":4}}},"block_order":["card_wAfbzn","card_BRBBfd","card_KzCYrR"],"name":"SS - Gallery #7","settings":{"cards_per_view":3,"cards_per_view_mobile":"1","cards_gap":32,"cards_gap_mobile":16,"card_padding_horizontal":12,"card_padding_horizontal_mobile":12,"card_padding_vertical":12,"card_padding_vertical_mobile":12,"card_radius":4,"card_border_thickness":0,"card_align":"center","card_align_mobile":"center","card_use_shadow":true,"image_radius":0,"image_border_thickness":0,"image_ratio":"square","image_ratio_mobile":"square","image_overlay":0.1,"title_custom":false,"title_font":"josefin_sans_n4","title_size":20,"title_size_mobile":20,"title_height":130,"title_mt":12,"title_mt_mobile":12,"text_custom":false,"text_font":"josefin_sans_n4","text_size":16,"text_size_mobile":16,"text_height":150,"text_mt":12,"text_mt_mobile":12,"card_bg_color":"#71c27a","card_bg_hover_color":"#71c27a","card_border_color":"#000000","card_border_hover_color":"#222222","title_color":"#09552b","title_hover_color":"#09552b","text_color":"#09552b","text_hover_color":"#09552b","image_border_color":"#000000","image_overlay_color":"#ffffff","background_color":"#fffefa","background_gradient":"","border_color":"#000000","margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"margin_horizontal":0,"margin_horizontal_mobile":0,"padding_top":32,"padding_bottom":100,"padding_horizontal":5,"padding_horizontal_mobile":2.5,"full_width":false,"content_width":1200,"border_thickness":0,"section_radius":0,"lazy":true}},"1745812846601c5247":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"judge_me_reviews_review_widget_4x6fU8":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/judge-me-reviews\/blocks\/review_widget\/61ccd3b1-a9f2-4160-9fe9-4fec8413e5d8","settings":{"review_data":"sample_data","max_width":1200}}},"block_order":["judge_me_reviews_review_widget_4x6fU8"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"include_margins":true}},"collapsible_content_MfbnFr":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"collapsible_row_9fQBHX":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How does RESCUE work?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>RESCUE is a specially formulated liquid treatment that helps neutralise dog urine<br\/>burn and promote new grass growth. It works by improving the soil condition and<br\/>encouraging recovery in damaged patches.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_KBEQG8":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"When should I apply RESCUE?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>For best results, apply as soon you see the patch turn yellow from your dog wee. The<br\/>sooner, the better! However, RESCUE can still be effective even days after the burn<br\/>occurs.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_gVLfwb":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How do I use RESCUE?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Mix the concentrate with water (1L makes up to 3L of product), pour it into a spray bottle or pump sprayer and apply it directly to the burnt patch. Flush with water around 24 hours after application or when product is dry on leaf.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_4drYFN":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"How soon will I see results?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Most people start seeing signs of recovery and new green growth within 1–2<br\/>weeks after application.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_dULhAz":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I use RESCUE on any type of grass?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Yes, RESCUE is safe to use on all common lawn types including buffalo, kikuyu,<br\/>and couch.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_dhkCPK":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Is it safe for pets and kids?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Once the product has dried, it’s completely safe for pets and kids to be on the<br\/>lawn.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_N8bN3a":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Will RESCUE prevent future burns?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>RESCUE is designed to repair damage, not prevent it. For prevention, try encouraging your dog to wee in a specific area or follow up with water immediately after they go.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_YEBieL":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I use it on large burnt areas?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Yes! Just make sure to cover the entire affected area evenly. For widespread<br\/>damage, you may need to repeat the application.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_m4wC8R":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Should I do reapply Rescue?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>You can reapply every 1–2 weeks if needed, depending on how quickly your lawn is recovering.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_zMPdzD":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Does the green dye stain?","icon":"none","row_content":"<p>Once it’s dry, it won’t stain but we still recommend being careful during application. The dye is turf safe and gives instant results while your lawn recovers<br\/>underneath.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_9fQBHX","collapsible_row_KBEQG8","collapsible_row_gVLfwb","collapsible_row_4drYFN","collapsible_row_dULhAz","collapsible_row_dhkCPK","collapsible_row_N8bN3a","collapsible_row_YEBieL","collapsible_row_m4wC8R","collapsible_row_zMPdzD"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.collapsible_content.presets.name","settings":{"caption":"","heading":"FAQ's","heading_size":"h1","heading_alignment":"left","layout":"none","color_scheme":"","container_color_scheme":"","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":100}},"related-products":{"type":"related-products","settings":{"heading":"Shop Our Lawn Care 